<div class="titleband" data-screen-label="Projects — title"><h1>The <span class="u-1">Projects</span></h1></div>
<div class="u-46 introband">
  <h2>From evidence to real cost reduction.</h2>
  <p>The Projects are how Uncost moves from evidence to action: open-source tools, data models, and automation playbooks that communities, co-ops, nonprofits, public agencies, and builders can run themselves. We don&rsquo;t own the farm — we publish the model, the sources, and the playbook so others can adopt and improve them.</p>
</div>

